One.

C002
00:00:22.315 --> 00:00:22.791
One.

C003
00:00:24.791 --> 00:00:25.365
Zero.

X003a
00:00:25.915 --> 00:00:29.318
The little number is the position. The big number is the value.

X003b
00:00:29.718 --> 00:00:32.860
At position two n, copy the value at position n.

X003c
00:00:33.260 --> 00:00:37.817
At position two n plus one, use one minus the value at position n.

X003d
00:00:38.217 --> 00:00:40.727
Zero becomes one. One becomes zero.

X003e
00:00:41.127 --> 00:00:44.650
Look back to the parent position, then follow the active formula.

